---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Inicio
description: Desarrollo web y aventuras tecnológicas.
active: home
permalink: /index.html
---
<div class="home-kicker"><span class="status-dot"></span> BITÁCORA PERSONAL · DESDE 2015</div>
<article class="home-content prose">{{ site.homePage.post_content | safe }}</article>
<section class="recent-posts" aria-labelledby="recent-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">LECTURAS RECIENTES</p>
      <h2 id="recent-heading">Desde la bitácora</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Ver todos los artículos <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in site.posts.slice(0, 3) %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <p class="card-date">{{ post.post_date | formatDate }}</p>
        <h3><a href="/{{ post.post_name }}/">{{ post.post_title | decodeEntities }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.post_excerpt or post.post_content | excerpt(150) }}</p>
        <a class="card-more" href="/{{ post.post_name }}/">Leer artículo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
